OL,3,GNEWSADoes Scotland's NHS have a
OL,4,Arevolving door problem with senior
OL,5,Amanagers?
OL,6,
OL,7,FA recurring theme in the debate over
OL,8,Fthe problems at NHS Grampian has been
OL,9,Fconcern at a revolving door of senior
OL,10,Fmanagers in Scotland's NHS.
OL,12,FA damning report published earlier this
OL,13,Fmonth found that failures to learn from
OL,14,Fmistakes in Grampian had caused
OL,15,F"repeated and avoidable harm" to
OL,16,Fpatients.
OL,18,FHealth Secretary Angela Constance has
OL,19,Fnow sent in a team of four expert
OL,20,Fleaders to help drive urgent change by
OL,21,Fproviding "external challenge, scrutiny
OL,22,Fand practical support".
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
