OL,3,GNEWSADoes Scotland's NHS have a
OL,4,Arevolving door problem with senior
OL,5,Amanagers?
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut three of them previously held
OL,8,Fsenior positions at other boards that
OL,9,Falso faced serious criticism.
